@host = http://localhost:5096

### Memory status
GET {{host}}/memory

### Leak 100 MB
POST {{host}}/leak/managed?mb=100

### Leak 500 MB (exceeds the 384 MB heap limit -> OOM -> auto dump)
POST {{host}}/leak/managed?mb=500

### Release everything
POST {{host}}/reset

### Native leak 100 MB (grows RSS, not the GC heap -> OOMKilled in a container, no OutOfMemoryException)
POST {{host}}/leak/native?mb=100
